# ability is independent of its source: Bot1 still surveils (keeping the Island), the sacrifice finds nothing to
# sacrifice, and the damage and the life gain still happen, the damage dealt by the artifact as it last existed (CR 113.7a,
# 608.2h). The Eye is in the graveyard once, not twice.

